        "original_id": "0128ceba-fee0-5f76-90bd-1a7168741404",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William McKinley\n- Laws: McKinley Tariff, Tariff Act of 1890\n- Organizations: United States Congress\n- Roles: Representative, President of the United States\n\nFacts:\n- William McKinley was born on January 29, 1843.\n- The Tariff Act of 1890, commonly called the McKinley Tariff, was framed by Representative William McKinley and became law on October 1, 1890.\n- William McKinley was the 25th President of the United States from March 4, 1897 until his assassination in September 1901, six months into his second term.\n- William McKinley died on September 14, 1901.",
